title Heavy load: a full song playing while a loop records over it, pads roll and an effect chain grows
covers load, fx-busy, hour
needs demo-songs
# The round plays this once on each sound-core setting (shared, core3, two,
# three) to pick the default from the numbers: the same steps every time,
# so the windows compare like for like.
wait 2
mark open
button BROWSE
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Glass Garden
tap browser row Glass Garden
wait 1
expect project: Glass Garden is in
mark song
tap header tab Arrange
tap clips scene Scene 2
tap transport play Play
expect time: scene 2
wait 15
mark song-and-loop
tap header tab Play
tap play-loop arm Arm
button REC
wait 4
button REC
wait 4
expect looper: loop of
mark song-loop-pads
pad 1 120 0.1
pad 2 110 0.1
pad 3 100 0.1
pad 4 90 0.1
pad 5 120 0.1
pad 6 110 0.1
pad 7 100 0.1
pad 8 90 0.1
pad 9 120 0.1
pad 10 110 0.1
pad 11 100 0.1
pad 12 90 0.1
pad 13 120 0.1
pad 14 110 0.1
pad 15 100 0.1
pad 16 90 0.1
pad 1 120 0.1
pad 5 120 0.1
pad 9 120 0.1
pad 13 120 0.1
wait 6
mark song-loop-fx
tap header tab Mix
tap mixer look Effects
tap mixer fx-add Drums + FX
tap chain section Delay and reverb
tap chain pick Reverb
tap chain add + Add effect
tap chain section Delay and reverb
tap chain pick Delay
tap chain add + Add effect
tap chain section Modulation
tap chain pick Chorus
wait 15
mark steady
# Everything at once for half a minute: the window the report reads the
# setting's worst period and underruns from.
wait 30
mark stop
button STOP
button STOP
expect STOP: all sounds stopped
